{pad:meta title='A day at the office', about='A user journey - steps in their sections, a face at the height of every score from 1 to 5, a dot for every person who takes the step.'/}
{diagram:journey}
  title A day at the office
  section Morning
    Make tea: 5: Me
    Read the mail: 2: Me, Cat
  section Afternoon
    Write the notes: 4: Me
    Fix the build: 1: Me, Team
  section Evening
    Go home: 5: Me, Cat
{/diagram:journey}
